**A.** 100 km/h.

solution:
Từ đồ thị $\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\mathit{v}_{1}\mathbf{=}\frac{40}{1}\mathbf{=}40\ km/h \\
\mathit{v}_{2}\mathbf{=}\frac{140}{2,5}\mathbf{=}56\ \mathit{k}m/\mathit{h}
\end{array} \right.\ \mathbf{\Rightarrow}\mathit{v}_{1}\mathbf{+}\mathit{v}_{2}\mathbf{=}96\ km/h$

